message: >-
  If you use CalibAgent, cite the archived release or exact commit. When the
  project paper DOI is added, cite both the paper and the software artifact.
title: "CalibAgent: Safe and Uncertainty-Aware Active Velocity Calibration for Quadruped Robots"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "EurekaZang"
abstract: >-
  Research software and frozen evidence for safe, uncertainty-aware active
  command-to-motion calibration, simulator domain-shift recovery, and
  downstream quadruped navigation evaluation.
